OL,3,GNEWSAScottish mountain rescue team
OL,4,Acalled out 200 times this year - a new
OL,5,Arecord
OL,6,
OL,7,FScotland's busiest mountain rescue team
OL,8,Fhas broken its record for the number of
OL,9,Fcall-outs it gets in a year.
OL,11,FFour incidents at the weekend pushed
OL,12,FFort William-based Lochaber MRT to more
OL,13,Fthan 200 for 2026 so far.
OL,15,FThe rescues included a missing person,
OL,16,Fan injured mountain biker and a group
OL,17,Fof hillwalkers unable to navigate off
OL,18,Fthe summit of Ben Nevis - Britain's
OL,19,Fhighest mountain - in the dark.
OL,23,APub: 06-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
