OL,3,GNEWSAScottish mountain rescue team
OL,4,Acalled out 200 times this year - a new
OL,5,Arecord
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe team, which attended 160 call-outs
OL,8,Ffor the whole of last year, said more
OL,9,Fpeople were heading into the hills,
OL,10,Fwith some poorly equipped or
OL,11,Fill-prepared for difficult conditions.
